Gantry-Shruti

Ingredients: FREE JAZZ / AVANT-GARDE + TRIPPY, SURREAL & PSYCHEDELIC + Sitar
Creative Catalyst: It began as subverted municipal protest music broadcast through hijacked traffic light induction loops and relay boxes.

Gantry-Shruti collides the explosive, polyrhythmic chaos of free jazz with the microtonal, liquid drones of psychedelic electric sitar, anchored by the rhythmic clicking of manipulated relay switches and tape-warped spatial delays.

